WEBVTT

00:18:28.130 --> 00:18:30.196
which poisoned her bloodstream.

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:33.206
Her body pulled all her blood
from her extremities,

00:18:33.230 --> 00:18:35.936
leaving her hands and feet to die slowly.

00:18:35.960 --> 00:18:38.736
FS: The good news is that we won
the volleyball tournament.

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:40.746
AG: Gradually, her hands got better,

00:18:40.770 --> 00:18:43.846
but her legs still weren't showing
any signs of healing.

00:18:43.870 --> 00:18:48.206
FS: The choice to have
my legs amputated was mine.

00:18:48.230 --> 00:18:50.806
I decided that I wanted
to move on with my life,

00:18:50.830 --> 00:18:53.446
that I would start
becoming independent again.

00:18:53.470 --> 00:18:56.886
AG: She spent another
three years at home in recovery,

00:18:56.910 --> 00:18:58.676
but she wasn't alone in the process.

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:00.896
Her managers and coworkers from SAP